    "body": "Problem:\r\n`require('lspconfig.util')` runs unconditionally on the top of the file, while it is not required for newer versions of Neovim.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nRun `require('lspconfig.util')` only after the branch for newer versions exits.",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-06T18:41:11Z",
